{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a lake of cats, and you have to catch all of them probably. Fishing at the Lake Full of Cats is a short, puzzle solving, cat collecting, fishing game set in a colorful stylized world. After finding a mysterious note in his cabin, Logan sets off on an adventure where you uncover the secrets of Silly Lake in a quest to fish up every last one of its pointy eared denizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of the various bait types, tools, and ever useful &quot;Catalogue&quot; along with your deductive puzzle solving skills to catch over 20 unique cat types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lake full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A different part of the lake, also full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A river full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A pond full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ryan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A cave pond full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Another pond full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Another river with only 1 cat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Various other bodies of water, which are also full of cats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963070/extras/a33f09bdebf15b0d23c8359f8fe4f70c.poster.avif?t=1756591294\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963070/extras/a33f09bdebf15b0d23c8359f8fe4f70c.webm?t=1756591294\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963070?t=1756591294","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/